ected object is the memo bound by the resolved share.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo first resolves the supplied share token, then retrieves the memo using the resolved share's memo ID.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":170,"endLine":178}]},{"id":"f-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The share-bound memo ID is passed into memo read-context construction, and the visible share condition requires the context share ID to equal the memo ID and the memo not to be SPACE-audience.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":178,"endLine":186},{"sourceId":"src-9e75daa81a2950f8","startLine":119,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible read control returns an allowed private decision when the share condition applies; otherwise private visibility requires an active viewer who is the author.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9e75daa81a2950f8","startLine":113,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the read check succeeds, the handler loads reactions and attachments, converts the memo, clears Parent, and returns the memo; a missing creator during conversion yields NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"A missing share or an expired share causes getActiveMemoShare to return NOT_FOUND; expiry is determined from ExpiresTs when present.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":217,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"f-inaccessible","kind":"condition","statement":"Within the specified handler, missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience memos yield NOT_FOUND, and a read-context error or disallowed read decision also yields NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"f-creator-check","kind":"control","statement":"The visible read decision rejects a nil memo or invalid creator as NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9e75daa81a2950f8","startLine":92,"endLine":96}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied token resolves to a share record rather than no record.","Whether the resolved share is expired under its ExpiresTs value.","Whether the token-resolution and subsequent store operations complete without an internal error."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe the result of getActiveMemoShare for the supplied token, including whether a share record exists and its expiry state.","If the share resolves, observe the resolved MemoID and confirm the handler's memo lookup and read check succeed.","Observe whether the post-check reaction, attachment, and memo-conversion operations succeed."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":5131,"output":1303,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":82717.78570000001,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T07:51:26.615Z"}}
