":["true","false","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":6427,"output":1536,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_W3kvwH7GFOzxJIlng1lvzdk4","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Atoken-status-unspecified::entry%3Aget-shared","decision":{"kind":"conditional-policy","policyStatus":"undetermined"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared GetSharedMemo entry, the caller is anonymous by premise, while the supplied task leaves token existence and expiry unspecified. The handler first calls getActiveMemoShare with the supplied token and, if that resolves, fetches the memo using the resolved share's MemoID. For a resolved, unexpired token, the handler passes that same share-bound ID into read-context construction. The visible read decision has a share branch for a memo whose ID equals the shared ID and whose visibility is not SPACE; that branch returns an allowed private decision. Under the stated premise that the associated memo is active, private, non-SPACE, and has a valid creator, the conditional success path proceeds to load reactions and attachments, convert the memo, clear Parent, and return it. An invalid or expired token is rejected by getActiveMemoShare with NOT_FOUND before memo retrieval. Within the specified handler, a missing memo, non-normal memo, or SPACE-audience memo also yields NOT_FOUND, as does a read-context error or a disallowed read decision. The source does not establish token existence or expiry for this request, so one concrete outcome cannot be selected. No separate requested memo identity is established; the protected object is the memo bound by the resolved share.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo resolves the supplied share token and then retrieves the memo using the resolved share's memo ID.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":170,"endLine":178}]},{"id":"f-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler supplies the resolved share's memo ID to memo read-context construction, and the visible share condition requires that shared ID to equal the memo ID while excluding SPACE-audience memos.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":178,"endLine":186},{"sourceId":"src-9e75daa81a2950f8","startLine":119,"endLine":122}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"When the share condition applies, the visible read control returns an allowed private decision; absent that branch, private visibility requires an active viewer who is the author.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9e75daa81a2950f8","startLine":113,"endLine":145}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After an allowed read check, the handler loads reactions and attachments, converts the memo, clears Parent, and returns the memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-token-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"A missing share record causes NOT_FOUND, and an expired share is also rejected before memo retrieval.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":217,"endLine":219},{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":221,"endLine":227}]},{"id":"f-inaccessible","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler returns NOT_FOUND for a missing, non-normal, or SPACE-audience memo, and also for a read-context error or a disallowed read decision.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-18aa6711378d2308","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]},{"id":"f-creator-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible read decision returns NOT_FOUND when the memo is nil or the creator is invalid.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9e75daa81a2950f8","startLine":92,"endLine":96}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether the supplied token resolves to a share record.","Whether the resolved share is unexpired under its ExpiresTs value."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe whether getActiveMemoShare resolves the supplied token to a share record.","If it resolves, observe whether the share is unexpired according to its ExpiresTs value."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":6427,"output":1536,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":46550.83770000003,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T07:52:13.170Z"}}
